* 30 fF per top node: comparator input load (r1_cmp input pair gate, estimated)
.control
set num_threads=1
tran 10p 1.12e-07 0 20p
meas tran ha0 find v(tap0,tan0) at=1.1e-07
meas tran da0 find v(tap0,tan0) at=1.105e-07
meas tran hb0 find v(tbp0,tbn0) at=1.1e-07
